+# Fetching this corpus
+
+The `files/` directory holds real-world `CLAUDE.md`/`AGENTS.md` files located via
+GitHub code search (grep.app) and fetched by the `svipall` fetch tool. Per
+`manifest.tsv`, files were fetched raw via `raw.githubusercontent.com`.
+
+## Per-domain rate limit
+
+The fetcher enforced a per-domain limit of **12 visits per 60-second window**.
+On breach, it applied a **900-second (15-minute) cooldown** before resuming
+requests to that domain.
+
+## Mirror/CDN hosts used
+
+- `raw.githubusercontent.com` (primary; confirmed in `manifest.tsv`'s header)
+- `cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/<owner>/<repo>@<branch>/<path>`
+- `cdn.statically.io` (observed to be slow / prone to timeouts)
+
+These mirror values are drawn from this project's own fetch-run history rather
+than the corpus files themselves; only `raw.githubusercontent.com` is directly
+corroborated by an artifact in this repo (`manifest.tsv`).
